# source-controller's default excludes drop common image extensions
# (.jpg/.jpeg/.png/.gif/...) from the GitRepository artifact entirely -
# silently, no error, kustomize-controller just can't find the file at
# build time. Un-exclude the specific images this repo actually needs
# built into a ConfigMap (apps/homepage's background image) rather than
# re-including all images repo-wide.
!clusters/homelab/apps/homepage/config/images/*.jpg
